    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game</h2><br>Siege 'n Sow is a chilling and minimalist real-time strategy game.<br><br>Play your way through rough days, collecting resources and expanding your territory, while enemies come for you after each day. If your king dies, you lose! Use units, towers and whatever in your control in order to protect them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/0142d631339066ab0675af3dbae6f2f6.poster.avif?t=1747336323\" width=640 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/0142d631339066ab0675af3dbae6f2f6.webm?t=1747336323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/0142d631339066ab0675af3dbae6f2f6.mp4?t=1747336323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Random generated maps<br></li><li> Campaign mode (short maps with specific missions to be accomplished)<br></li><li> Endless mode \u2014 survive enemy attacks after each day and get to the leaderboards!<br></li><li> Chill gameplay \u2014 listen to something else while playing, still having a challenging game</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/f4a14d7f7143df57ed507d9974230e9b.poster.avif?t=1747336323\" width=640 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/f4a14d7f7143df57ed507d9974230e9b.webm?t=1747336323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773700/extras/f4a14d7f7143df57ed507d9974230e9b.mp4?t=1747336323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
